description:
Welcome to Central Parc, situated in one of the most beautiful residential communities in the Northwest. Nike, Intel, and Columbia Sportswear, and the Hwy26 interchange are all only a few minutes away, and Bethany Village is a mere one-block walk away for groceries, great restaurants, and every amenity you need for daily life.
* Built in 2000; 
* kitchen with stainless steel appliances;
* Electric zonal heat, gas fireplace;
* Community amenities: gated community, swimming pool, hot tub, gym; 
* Carport parking #33
Please send email stating interest and questions, and I will email you an application. Application entails background/credit check which has a $35 fee. Thanks!

Owner pay for HOA garbage, insurance, tenant responsible for all of the utilities.
